116601,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said, ""Abu Bakr as-Siddiq used to pray witr when he wished to go to bed, and Umar ibn al-Khattab used to pray witr at the end of the night. As for me, I pray witr when I go to bed"
116602,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said, ""Abu Bakr as-Siddiq used to pray witr when he wished to go to bed, and Umar ibn al-Khattab used to pray witr at the end of the night. As for me, I pray witr when I go to bed"
116701,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Jafar ibn Muhammad from his father that Ali ibn Abi Talib used to say, ""The least difficult thing acceptable as a sacrificial animal is a sheep"
116702,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Jafar ibn Muhammad from his father that Ali ibn Abi Talib used to say, ""The least difficult thing acceptable as a sacrificial animal is a sheep"
